    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-8 Player Local PVP </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your playstyle with unique guns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/4824815360c98126b4b252c8c86ce01d.poster.avif?t=1746625195\" width=586 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/4824815360c98126b4b252c8c86ce01d.webm?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/4824815360c98126b4b252c8c86ce01d.mp4?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful special attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/9dd8da0d29ec14395be7bdb5f031b5f4.poster.avif?t=1746625195\" width=528 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/9dd8da0d29ec14395be7bdb5f031b5f4.webm?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/9dd8da0d29ec14395be7bdb5f031b5f4.mp4?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/22f29694ccb7a6aea07acde881a0e76b.poster.avif?t=1746625195\" width=528 height=484 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/22f29694ccb7a6aea07acde881a0e76b.webm?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/22f29694ccb7a6aea07acde881a0e76b.mp4?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll for increased speed and<strong> pop up just in time to eliminate your friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/d7570a88f76edafef678f8f3acc5b464.poster.avif?t=1746625195\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/d7570a88f76edafef678f8f3acc5b464.webm?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269830/extras/d7570a88f76edafef678f8f3acc5b464.mp4?t=1746625195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle for the crown in four engaging game modes (more to come)!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towel Royale</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Towel Royale</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of the Crown</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team of the Crown</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now in<strong>\u00a08</strong>\u00a0different languages!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portuguese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese (Simplified)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Korean</p></li></ul>",
